  "scope": "Deterministic engine contracts on application-supplied typed records. No LLM, extraction or end-to-end benchmark. Block A reuses benchmarks/functional_parity fixtures and adapters unchanged for v2/v3; v4 receives the same records. Block B contracts were written from the revised paper before running. Each arm receives the same records translated into its API: v2 inference_type (explicit->deductive), origin_tier from rank (100/50/10), dependence_group; v3 has no basis field; v4 receives basis. v2 multivalued predicates come from its built-in predicate list; v3/v4 from declared cardinality. P10 uses v2 core DependencyGraph directly; v3 has no heterogeneous path ranking.",
